(text "BACK / REAR PHOTO VIEW\nJ1 (5V) top-left; A1 (CLK) top-right\nSocket IDs are immutable; this is NOT a footprint view." (at 28 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "335804e4-b571-587a-bfcc-ed4c469fe148"))
(text "USB-powered DevKit; J1 / 5V feeds only the status ring (J5).\nJ19 supplies +3V3. All three GND sockets connected.\nOnboard USB-UART, regulator, BOOT and EN retained.\nPAIR is the onboard BOOT button (GPIO0, A6): no carrier wiring; A6 stays NC.\nDISPLAY STRAP: A7 (GPIO4) left open = E-ink board (firmware pull-up)." (at 28 157 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "14c88331-926e-58f7-84c0-bfae52a1f004"))
