(text "Unmarked 5-pin analog thumbstick; pins in module order.\n\"+5V\" pin is fed 3.3 V: VRX/VRY swing to the supply and the\nESP32 ADC must not see 5 V. SW is a switch to GND (internal pull-up).\nDirections + click are the five menu keys (on-screen compass).\nAxis direction depends on mounting; firmware can swap/invert.\nFirmware: Sigil PlatformIO env sigil (E-ink build)." (at 290 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ef19b7f6-9fc7-566c-a3bc-76a95a014368"))
